#: ../../source/docs/common-generators.rst:10 2729a09e9cc54b679fafdcd0f38d05a0
msgid ""
"ArduPilot supports generators for powering your vehicle.  Some generators "
"can be controlled from ArduPilot, others are telemetry only.  Within "
"ArduPilot the term generator is used to broadly group all devices that "
"convert some form of fuel into electrical power."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 支持发电机为飞行器供电。某些发电机可以由 ArduPilot 控制，其他仅提供数传。在 ArduPilot "
"中，「发电机」一词用于泛指所有将某种燃料转化为电力的设备。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-generators.rst:12 4979209061b74bac92cf3b20cbde1159
